{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>ProUser 是一款把日常句子直接化成行事曆行程的工具，用戶只需輸入「明天九時與 Sam 喝咖啡」這類描述，行程便會自動建立，毋須翻查選單或日期選擇器。語言解析全程在裝置上完成，離線亦可運作，不設帳戶，亦不收集任何資料。它特別適合行程密集、思考速度快於點按速度的人。現時由原價 US $0.99 改為<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-23.webp\"/></figure>\n\n\n<h2>離線語句指令建立行程</h2>\n\n\n<p>指令欄支援直接輸入或語音輸入，用戶寫下「週五上午七時健身」即可建立行程，亦可要求系統在指定時段內找出首個空檔，安排兩小時的深度工作。以自然語言修改時間、縮短或改名同樣可行，清空某個下午只需一句指令，所有變更均可即時復原。另設待辦清單與鎖定畫面快速新增，常用項目只需定義一次。</p>\n\n\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-264-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-265-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-266-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-267-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-268-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-269-scaled.jpg\"/></figure></figure>\n\n\n<ul><li>應用名稱：ProUser: Command Your Day</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/prouser-command-your-day/id6783316662?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:46.099517+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":372,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:04:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_hash":"aff816686a21fb9bb07ce985581bf1d1a6b7d86561879ce99c49284e6d16dd01","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}